# Normalise every text file to LF in the repository.
#
# Editing tools on Windows silently mix CRLF and LF into the same file — by
# the time this was added, server.js had drifted to 484 CRLF lines alongside
# 469 LF ones. Mixed endings make diffs unreadable, hide the real changes in
# whitespace noise, and are the reason a "\n" search-and-replace can appear to
# do nothing. Pinning the whole repo to LF keeps the working tree, the index
# and the stored blob in agreement.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.mp3  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
